   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Russia, St. Petersburg, the picturesque Moika river embankment at sunset, the colored facades of houses and their reflection on the water, the beginning of river navigation without tourist boats</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
